		"@okikio/version": {
			"module_doc": {
				"doc": "Resolve release evidence by scheme and precision instead of trusting lexical order or whichever detector has the highest priority. A coarse version observation should not erase a compatible exact release.\n\nStart with SemVer evidence, add numeric dotted schemes for vendor formats, and retain conflicting exact candidates for review. Compatible refinement takes precedence over source priority. A scheme describes version ordering and compatibility; it does not discover the software or establish that an observed version is trustworthy.\n",
				"tags": [
					{
						"kind": "example",
						"doc": "```ts\nimport { createVersionSchemeCatalog, resolveVersionCandidates, semanticVersionScheme } from '@okikio/version';\nconst schemes = createVersionSchemeCatalog([semanticVersionScheme]);\nconst value = resolveVersionCandidates([\n  { value: '2', schemeId: 'semver', source: 'header', sourcePriority: 100 },\n  { value: '2.4.6', schemeId: 'semver', source: 'asset', sourcePriority: 20 },\n], schemes);\nconsole.log(value.status, value.selected?.value);\n```\n"
					},
					{
						"kind": "module"
					}
				]
			},
